  "controlsRationale": "Original menu uses relative mouse and left click; cursor starts0,0 and rejects out-of-bounds glyph movement, so pointer move with positive in-bounds swipes is used. Right arrow pad moves/rotates/soft-drops pieces, Space swaps pieces. Left AD pad and W Jump preserve the additional local Battle character controls. Panel keeps controls outside both game boards in landscape and portrait. Actual browser touch passed both local modes.",
  "artwork": {
    "icon": "Original purple T tetromino img/t.bmp enlarged with nearest-neighbor pixels over a plain dark background.",
    "preview": "Real single-player gameplay canvas captured after touch-driven piece rotation, swap and soft drop."
  },
  "verification": {
    "browser": "Landscape single-player POINTS10 and settled piece; Battle character and falling pieces; portrait settled piece. Game running/errors[] in all.",
    "native": "Configured native compilation passes; owning bitmap loader header correction is covered by red/green actual-source pointer identity regression. Actual Android startup/gameplay pending."
  },
